flowchart TD
    A["缺陷出现（Defect）"] --> B["代理修补可见症状（Patch the symptom）"]
    B --> C{"可以就此收手吗？（Acceptable?）"}
    C -- "一次性·低风险" --> D["直接修复即可（Direct fix fine）"]
    C -- "复发·生产·架构级" --> E["要求诊断工件（Require a diagnosis artifact）"]
    E --> F["写明根因与机理（Root cause and mechanism）"]
    F --> G["识别同因波及面（Blast radius）"]
    G --> H["针对根因修复（Fix the cause）"]
    H --> I["沉淀为可复用证据（Reusable knowledge）"]
    I -. "同因再现：回到诊断" .-> F
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class E,F,G,H core;
    class C gate;
    class A,B,D,I out;
